  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Aura</strong> moderate Destruction; <strong>CL</strong> 6th<br>\n<strong>Slot</strong> wrists; <strong>Price</strong> 8,000 gp; <strong>Weight</strong> 1&nbsp;lb.</p>\n<p><strong>Description</strong><br>\nEach pair of blaster’s bracers are a +1 Destruction implement and are imbued with one (blast shape) talent when created. The wearer may treat this talent as a talent known while wearing the bracers. Both bracers must be worn to have any effect and they require a 24 hours attunement period before use.</p>\n<p><strong>Construction Requirements</strong><br>\nCraft Implement Of Power, Destruction sphere, creator must possess the talent to be granted; <strong>Cost</strong> 4,000 gp</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/implements#toc4\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
